msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「How do you feel? Think you can walk＿now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo te sientes? ¿Crees＿que ya puedas caminar?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, yeah...... Wanna go home now?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, sí...... ¿Volvemos a casa ya?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. It's freezing. Aren't you cold?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Está helando. ¿No tienes frío?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Good point. Let's go home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Tienes razón. Vámonos a casa.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Ngh!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Ngh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not nothing...... Did you get a＿blister?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que es algo......＿¿Te salió una ampolla?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sorry. Here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Perdón. Sube.」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you doing?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué estás haciendo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll carry you. After you went to the＿trouble of looking for me, it's the least＿I can do.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te llevaré cargada. Después de＿que te molestaste en buscarme,＿es lo menos que puedo hacer.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Fair enough. If we stay here much＿longer, you could catch the flu again.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Está bien. Si seguimos aquí más＿tiempo, te puede dar gripe otra vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Climb on already. It's extremely＿embarrassing to be in this position in＿public.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sube de una vez. Es sumamente vergonzoso＿estar en esta postura en público.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut it! Hold still!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Quédate quieto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngggh! You're choking me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ngggh! ¡Me estás ahorcando!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Are you warm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Ya entraste en calor?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hey, a little while ago you asked me＿if I was glad to be spending New Year's＿with you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Oye, hace un rato me preguntaste＿si me alegraba pasar el Año＿Nuevo contigo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about you? Wasn't there＿someone else you'd want to spend it＿with?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y tú? ¿No había alguien más con＿quien quisieras pasarlo?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Not really, no.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......En realidad, no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Why do you ask?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué lo preguntas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... I don't really know, but I had＿this nagging feeling.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... No lo sé bien, pero＿tenía ese presentimiento.」"

msgid "Taiga「Are you remembering something?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Estás recordando algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So I was right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Así que tenía razón?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga's crush...... who is it? I'm sure I＿know the answer, but......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Quién le gusta a Taiga......? Seguro＿que sé la respuesta, pero......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No. Not him.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No. Él no.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Definitely not that guy......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Definitivamente ese tipo no......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Not him either......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tampoco es él......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kitamura......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Kitamura......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's it, Kitamura! It's Kitamura!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Eso es, Kitamura! ¡Es Kitamura!」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh...... Y-Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah...... S-Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sorry about that. If I had only＿remembered it sooner, I wouldn't have＿imposed myself on you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Lo siento por eso. Si tan＿solo lo hubiera recordado antes,＿no te habría molestado así.」"

msgid "Taiga「Right now we have to prioritize＿regaining your memories.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora mismo tenemos que priorizar＿que recuperes tus recuerdos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, you aren't the most patient＿person.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, no eres la persona más paciente.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Somehow it helped me remember......＿I'm glad.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De algún modo me ayudó a recordar......＿Me alegro.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Isn't this just what you wished for?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿No era esto lo que deseabas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My wish came true much earlier.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mi deseo se cumplió mucho antes.」"

msgid "Taiga「What does that mean?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué significa eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What an amazing deity. Perhaps it was＿worth the ¥100 offering?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué deidad tan increíble. ¿Será que sí＿valió la pena la ofrenda de ¥100?」"

msgid "Taiga「......That's amazing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Es increíble.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngggh! ......Why are you choking me!?＿I'm dying!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ngggh! ......¡¿Por qué me＿ahorcas?! ¡Me muero!」"

msgid "Taiga「It's payback for teasing me. To make＿matters worse, I'm cold.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es venganza por burlarte de mí.＿Para colmo, tengo frío.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry then, sheesh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón entonces, cielos......」"

msgid "Taiga「......Well, I was walking around all over＿the place, so I didn't have a choice, did＿I?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bueno, estuve caminando por todas＿partes, así que no tuve opción, ¿no?」"

msgid "Taiga「If I lost the family dog, I could never＿show my face to Yacchan again.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Si perdía al perro de la familia, nunca＿podría mirar a Yacchan a la cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just before you found me, I cancelled＿my wishes and instead asked to find＿you quickly.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Justo antes de que me encontraras,＿cancelé mis deseos y pedí mejor＿encontrarte rápido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「After that, we found each other in no＿time.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Después de eso, nos encontramos＿en un instante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm sure it will grant your wishes too......＿Oh, was that it? Your wish was about＿Kitamura? Then it'll work out for sure.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Seguro cumplirá los tuyos también......＿Ah, ¿era eso? ¿Tu deseo era sobre＿Kitamura? Entonces saldrá bien sin duda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's good.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué bien.」"
